<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Still Wandering"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="还在流浪"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="還在流浪"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Jay Chou"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="周杰伦"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="周杰倫"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Greatest Works of Art"/><amll:meta key="album" value="最伟大的作品"/><amll:meta key="album" value="最偉大的作品"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="TWK972201203"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000Zu3Ah1jb4gl"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="361947419"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="08lvLdFzi5oNDhWVn58RWO"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1633408722"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:05.070"><div begin="18.880" end="4:05.070"><p begin="18.880" end="22.040" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.880" end="19.050">老</span><span begin="19.050" end="19.220">书</span><span begin="19.220" end="19.400">摊</span> <span begin="19.400" end="19.570">和</span><span begin="19.570" end="19.720">啤</span><span begin="19.720" end="19.920">酒</span><span begin="19.920" end="20.300">空</span><span begin="20.300" end="20.820">罐</span> <span begin="20.820" end="21.030">散</span><span begin="21.030" end="21.400">落</span><span begin="21.400" end="21.580">地</span><span begin="21.710" end="22.040">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">老書攤 和啤酒空罐 散落地上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Old book stalls and empty beer cans scattered on the ground</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">古本屋台とビールの空き缶が 地面に散らばる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">낡은 책 가판대와 빈 맥주 캔이 바닥에 흩어져 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les vieux stands de livres et les canettes de bière vides s&apos;éparpillent sur le sol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Puestos de libros viejos y latas de cerveza vacías esparcidos en el suelo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein alter Bücherstand und leere Bierdosen liegen verstreut auf dem Boden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Banca de livros velhos e latas de cerveja vazias espalhadas pelo chão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старая книжная лавка и пустые пивные банки разбросаны по земле</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vecchie bancarelle di libri e lattine vuote di birra sparse a terra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">lao shu tan he pi jiu kong guan san luo di shang</span></p><p begin="23.210" end="26.340" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.210" end="23.400">报</span><span begin="23.400" end="23.570">废</span><span begin="23.570" end="23.760">的</span><span begin="23.760" end="23.920">回</span><span begin="23.920" end="24.090">忆</span><span begin="24.090" end="24.300">在</span><span begin="24.300" end="24.480">路</span><span begin="24.640" end="25.210">旁</span> <span begin="25.210" end="25.350">有</span><span begin="25.350" end="25.480">了</span><span begin="25.690" end="26.080">锈</span><span begin="26.080" end="26.340">斑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">報廢的回憶在路旁 有了鏽斑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Scrapped memories by the roadside have gotten rust spots</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">廃棄された思い出は道端で 錆びついている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">길가에 버려진 추억엔 녹이 슬었지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les souvenirs mis au rebut sur le bas-côté se couvrent de rouille</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los recuerdos desechados junto al camino tienen manchas de óxido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verfallene Erinnerungen am Straßenrand haben Rostflecken angesetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Memórias descartadas na beira da estrada ganharam manchas de ferrugem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Выброшенные воспоминания у обочины покрылись ржавчиной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I ricordi scartati ai margini della strada si sono arrugginiti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bao fei de hui yi zai lu pang you le xiu ban</span></p><p begin="27.480" end="31.030" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.480" end="27.720">有</span><span begin="27.720" end="27.880">某</span><span begin="27.880" end="28.080">种</span><span begin="28.080" end="28.220">无</span><span begin="28.220" end="28.610">所</span><span begin="28.610" end="28.860">谓</span> <span begin="29.680" end="29.880">在</span><span begin="29.880" end="30.040">这</span><span begin="30.040" end="30.220">小</span><span begin="30.220" end="30.420">镇</span><span begin="30.420" end="30.840">弥</span><span begin="30.840" end="31.030">漫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">有某種無所謂 在這小鎮瀰漫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A certain kind of indifference permeates this small town</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どこかどうでもいいような空気が この小さな町に漂う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어떤 무관심함이 이 작은 마을에 감돌아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une sorte d&apos;indifférence imprègne cette petite ville</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una especie de indiferencia impregna este pequeño pueblo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Art Gleichgültigkeit durchdringt diese kleine Stadt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Há um certo tipo de indiferença permeando esta pequena cidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Какое-то безразличие витает в этом маленьком городке</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una sorta di indifferenza permea questa cittadina</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">you mou zhong wu suo wei zai zhe xiao zhen mi man</span></p><p begin="31.870" end="35.070" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.870" end="32.080">这</span><span begin="32.080" end="32.200">个</span><span begin="32.200" end="32.410">城</span><span begin="32.410" end="32.590">市</span><span begin="32.590" end="32.760">步</span><span begin="32.760" end="32.900">调</span> <span begin="32.900" end="33.320">是</span><span begin="33.320" end="33.590">如</span><span begin="33.590" end="34.020">此</span><span begin="34.020" end="34.180">的</span><span begin="34.400" end="34.750">缓</span><span begin="34.750" end="35.070">慢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這個城市步調 是如此的緩慢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The pace of this city is so slow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この街の歩みは これほどまでに穏やかだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 도시의 발걸음은 이토록 느릿해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le rythme de cette ville est d&apos;une telle lenteur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El ritmo de esta ciudad es tan lento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Tempo dieser Stadt ist so furchtbar langsam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O ritmo desta cidade é tão lento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ритм этого города такой неспешный</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il ritmo di questa città è così lento</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhe ge cheng shi bu diao shi ru ci de huan man</span></p><p begin="36.240" end="39.360" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.240" end="36.400">霓</span><span begin="36.400" end="36.560">虹</span><span begin="36.560" end="36.700">灯</span><span begin="36.700" end="36.890">闪</span><span begin="36.890" end="37.090">烁</span><span begin="37.090" end="37.170">的</span><span begin="37.270" end="37.690">倒</span><span begin="37.690" end="38.200">影</span> <span begin="38.200" end="38.350">靠</span><span begin="38.350" end="38.720">在</span><span begin="38.720" end="39.080">窗</span><span begin="39.080" end="39.360">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">霓虹燈閃爍的倒影 靠在窗上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The flickering reflection of neon lights leans against the window</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ネオンの瞬く影が 窓辺に寄り添う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">반짝이는 네온사인 불빛이 창문에 비치고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le reflet scintillant des néons s&apos;appuie contre la vitre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El reflejo parpadeante de las luces de neón se apoya en la ventana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die flackernden Spiegelungen der Neonlichter lehnen am Fenster</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O reflexo cintilante das luzes de neon encosta na janela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мерцающее отражение неоновых огней ложится на окно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il riflesso tremolante delle luci al neon si appoggia sulla finestra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ni hong deng shan shuo de dao ying kao zai chuang shang</span></p><p begin="40.510" end="44.060" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.510" end="40.730">错</span><span begin="40.730" end="40.910">过</span><span begin="40.910" end="41.090">美</span><span begin="41.090" end="41.260">好</span><span begin="41.260" end="41.430">的</span><span begin="41.430" end="41.600">那</span><span begin="41.600" end="41.980">时</span><span begin="41.980" end="42.510">光</span> <span begin="42.510" end="42.690">能</span><span begin="42.690" end="43.080">否</span><span begin="43.080" end="43.470">再</span><span begin="43.470" end="43.770">遇</span><span begin="43.770" end="44.060">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">錯過美好的那時光 能否再遇上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Can the missed beautiful times be encountered again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すれ違ったあの美しい時間に また巡り会えるだろうか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">놓쳐버린 그 아름다운 시절을 다시 만날 수 있을까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces beaux moments manqués pourrons-nous nous y recroiser ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esos hermosos tiempos perdidos podré volver a encontrarlos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Können wir jene verpasste schöne Zeit wohl wiederfinden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquele belo tempo perdido será que podemos encontrar de novo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сможем ли мы вновь встретить то прекрасное упущенное время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Potrò mai ritrovare quei bei momenti perduti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">cuo guo mei hao de na shi guang neng fou zai yu shang</span></p><p begin="44.860" end="48.340" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.860" end="45.060">老</span><span begin="45.060" end="45.250">旧</span><span begin="45.250" end="45.600">的</span><span begin="45.600" end="45.960">车</span><span begin="45.960" end="46.130">站</span> <span begin="47.040" end="47.230">空</span><span begin="47.230" end="47.420">旷</span><span begin="47.420" end="47.750">的</span><span begin="47.750" end="48.120">车</span><span begin="48.120" end="48.340">厢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">老舊的車站 空曠的車廂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The old station and the empty carriage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">古びた駅 がらんとした車両</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">낡고 오래된 역, 텅 빈 객차</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La vieille gare les wagons déserts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La vieja estación los vagones vacíos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein alter Bahnhof und leere Waggons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A velha estação os vagões vazios</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старая станция пустой вагон</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La vecchia stazione le carrozze vuote</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">lao jiu de che zhan kong kuang de che xiang</span></p><p begin="49.190" end="51.780" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.190" end="49.400">怀</span><span begin="49.400" end="49.560">念</span><span begin="49.560" end="49.750">从</span><span begin="49.750" end="49.920">前</span><span begin="49.920" end="50.090">的</span><span begin="50.090" end="50.300">人</span><span begin="50.300" end="50.690">来</span><span begin="50.690" end="51.020">人</span><span begin="51.020" end="51.780">往</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">懷念從前的人來人往</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Missing the bustling crowds from the past</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">昔の人の行き交う姿が懐かしい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">예전에 북적이던 사람들이 그리워져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nostalgique du va-et-vient des gens d&apos;autrefois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Extraño el ir y venir de la gente de antes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich vermisse das geschäftige Treiben von einst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sinto falta do vai e vem de pessoas de antigamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скучаю по суете людей что была раньше</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi manca il viavai di persone di un tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">huai nian cong qian de ren lai ren wang</span></p><p begin="53.530" end="56.950" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.530" end="53.770">招</span><span begin="53.770" end="53.830">牌</span><span begin="53.940" end="54.280">的</span><span begin="54.280" end="54.640">灯</span><span begin="54.640" end="54.820">泡</span> <span begin="55.690" end="55.870">在</span><span begin="55.870" end="56.080">夜</span><span begin="56.080" end="56.440">里</span><span begin="56.440" end="56.830">微</span><span begin="56.830" end="56.950">亮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">招牌的燈泡 在夜裡微亮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The signboard&apos;s lightbulb shines faintly in the night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">看板の電球が 夜の帳にほのかに灯る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">간판의 전구는 밤중에 희미하게 빛나고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les ampoules de l&apos;enseigne brillent doucement dans la nuit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las bombillas del letrero brillan tenuemente en la noche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Glühbirne des Schildes leuchtet schwach in der Nacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As lâmpadas do letreiro brilham fracamente na noite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лампочка на вывеске тускло светится в ночи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le lampadine dell&apos;insegna brillano debolmente nella notte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhao pai de deng pao zai ye li wei liang</span></p><p begin="57.870" end="1:01.160" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.870" end="58.070">过</span><span begin="58.070" end="58.250">去</span><span begin="58.250" end="58.520">的</span><span begin="58.620" end="58.820">背</span><span begin="58.960" end="59.320">包</span> <span begin="59.320" end="59.720">就</span><span begin="59.720" end="59.960">留</span><span begin="1:00.060" end="1:00.420">在</span><span begin="1:00.420" end="1:00.570">异</span><span begin="1:00.750" end="1:01.160">乡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">過去的背包 就留在異鄉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The backpack of the past is left in a foreign land</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">過去のバックパックは 異郷に置いてきた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">과거의 배낭은 타향에 남겨둔 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai laissé mon sac à dos du passé dans cette terre étrangère</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La mochila del pasado se queda en una tierra extranjera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Rucksack der Vergangenheit lasse ich in der Fremde zurück</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A mochila do passado fica na terra estrangeira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старый рюкзак так и остался на чужбине</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lo zaino del passato è rimasto in una terra straniera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">guo qu de bei bao jiu liu zai yi xiang</span></p><p begin="1:02.060" end="1:07.260" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.060" end="1:02.210">于</span><span begin="1:02.210" end="1:02.620">是</span><span begin="1:02.620" end="1:02.810">我</span><span begin="1:02.920" end="1:03.150">决</span><span begin="1:03.310" end="1:03.670">定</span> <span begin="1:03.670" end="1:03.860">离</span><span begin="1:03.980" end="1:04.360">开</span><span begin="1:04.360" end="1:04.760">这</span><span begin="1:04.760" end="1:05.010">个</span><span begin="1:05.130" end="1:05.350">地</span><span begin="1:05.450" end="1:07.260">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是我決定 離開這個地方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I decided to leave this place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だから僕は この場所を離れると決めた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 난 이 곳을 떠나기로 했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors j&apos;ai décidé de quitter cet endroit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así que decidí irme de este lugar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Also beschließe ich diesen Ort zu verlassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então eu decidi sair deste lugar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я решил покинуть это место</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così ho deciso di lasciare questo posto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu shi wo jue ding li kai zhe ge di fang</span></p><p begin="1:09.830" end="1:13.360" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.830" end="1:10.210">当</span><span begin="1:10.210" end="1:10.360">你</span><span begin="1:10.510" end="1:10.920">收</span><span begin="1:10.920" end="1:11.270">到</span><span begin="1:11.270" end="1:11.620">信</span> <span begin="1:11.620" end="1:11.820">我</span><span begin="1:11.950" end="1:12.340">还</span><span begin="1:12.340" end="1:12.720">在</span><span begin="1:12.720" end="1:13.100">流</span><span begin="1:13.100" end="1:13.360">浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當你收到信 我還在流浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you receive the letter I am still wandering</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君が手紙を受け取る頃 僕はまだ彷徨っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 편지를 받을 때쯤, 난 여전히 방랑하고 있겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand tu recevras cette lettre j&apos;errerai encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando recibas la carta yo todavía estaré vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du diesen Brief erhältst wandere ich noch immer umher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando você receber a carta eu ainda estarei vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда ты получишь письмо я всё ещё буду странствовать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando riceverai la lettera io starò ancora vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dang ni shou dao xin wo hai zai liu lang</span></p><p begin="1:14.170" end="1:17.660" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.170" end="1:14.550">那</span><span begin="1:14.550" end="1:14.890">年</span><span begin="1:14.890" end="1:15.230">的</span><span begin="1:15.230" end="1:15.630">约</span><span begin="1:15.630" end="1:15.970">定</span> <span begin="1:15.970" end="1:16.170">都</span><span begin="1:16.280" end="1:16.690">放</span><span begin="1:16.690" end="1:16.890">在</span><span begin="1:17.010" end="1:17.390">心</span><span begin="1:17.390" end="1:17.660">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那年的約定 都放在心上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The promise from that year is kept in my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの年の約束は 全て心にしまってある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그해의 약속은 모두 마음속에 간직하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les promesses de cette année-là je les garde dans mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las promesas de aquel año las guardo todas en mi corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Versprechen von damals trage ich tief im Herzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A promessa daquele ano está toda guardada no coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Обещание того года всё ещё храню в сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tengo ancora nel cuore la promessa di quell&apos;anno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na nian de yue ding dou fang zai xin shang</span></p><p begin="1:18.450" end="1:22.340" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.450" end="1:18.850">随</span><span begin="1:18.850" end="1:19.220">身</span><span begin="1:19.220" end="1:19.360">的</span><span begin="1:19.360" end="1:19.560">照</span><span begin="1:19.560" end="1:19.930">片</span><span begin="1:19.930" end="1:20.150">里</span> <span begin="1:20.660" end="1:21.030">你</span><span begin="1:21.030" end="1:21.140">微</span><span begin="1:21.310" end="1:21.560">笑</span><span begin="1:21.560" end="1:21.640">的</span><span begin="1:21.750" end="1:22.110">模</span><span begin="1:22.110" end="1:22.340">样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">隨身的照片裡 你微笑的模樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your smiling face in the photo I carry with me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">持ち歩く写真の中の 君の微笑む姿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">늘 지니고 다니는 사진 속 네가 웃는 모습</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans la photo que je garde sur moi la douceur de ton sourire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En la foto que llevo conmigo tu forma de sonreír</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf dem Foto das ich bei mir trage ist dein Lächeln zu sehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Na foto que carrego comigo o jeito do seu sorriso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">На фотографии что всегда со мной твоя улыбка</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nella foto che porto con me c&apos;è il tuo sorriso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sui shen de zhao pian li ni wei xiao de mo yang</span></p><p begin="1:22.800" end="1:26.740" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.800" end="1:23.190">亲</span><span begin="1:23.190" end="1:23.560">爱</span><span begin="1:23.560" end="1:23.830">的</span> <span begin="1:23.940" end="1:24.050">你</span><span begin="1:24.220" end="1:24.610">现</span><span begin="1:24.610" end="1:24.810">在</span><span begin="1:24.980" end="1:25.710">怎</span><span begin="1:25.710" end="1:26.100">么</span><span begin="1:26.100" end="1:26.740">样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親愛的 你現在怎麼樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My dear how are you doing now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">親愛なる君よ 今はどうしているの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 사랑, 넌 지금 어떻게 지내고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ma chérie comment vas-tu à présent ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Querida cómo estás tú ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Liebling wie geht es dir jetzt?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Querida como você está agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дорогая как ты сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mia cara come stai adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">qin ai de ni xian zai zen me yang</span></p><p begin="1:27.160" end="1:30.640" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.160" end="1:27.530">当</span><span begin="1:27.530" end="1:27.640">你</span><span begin="1:27.850" end="1:28.250">收</span><span begin="1:28.250" end="1:28.610">到</span><span begin="1:28.610" end="1:28.960">信</span> <span begin="1:28.960" end="1:29.140">我</span><span begin="1:29.270" end="1:29.700">还</span><span begin="1:29.700" end="1:30.080">在</span><span begin="1:30.080" end="1:30.450">流</span><span begin="1:30.450" end="1:30.640">浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當你收到信 我還在流浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you receive the letter I am still wandering</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君が手紙を受け取る頃 僕はまだ彷徨っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 편지를 받을 때쯤, 난 여전히 방랑하고 있겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand tu recevras cette lettre j&apos;errerai encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando recibas la carta yo todavía estaré vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du diesen Brief erhältst wandere ich noch immer umher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando você receber a carta eu ainda estarei vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда ты получишь письмо я всё ещё буду странствовать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando riceverai la lettera io starò ancora vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dang ni shou dao xin wo hai zai liu lang</span></p><p begin="1:31.440" end="1:35.010" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.440" end="1:31.850">想</span><span begin="1:31.850" end="1:32.200">起</span><span begin="1:32.200" end="1:32.580">牵</span><span begin="1:32.580" end="1:32.920">着</span><span begin="1:32.920" end="1:33.290">手</span> <span begin="1:33.290" end="1:33.660">走</span><span begin="1:33.660" end="1:34.060">过</span><span begin="1:34.060" end="1:34.220">的</span><span begin="1:34.350" end="1:34.740">小</span><span begin="1:34.740" end="1:35.010">巷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想起牽著手 走過的小巷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Thinking of the alley we walked through holding hands</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">手を繋いで歩いた あの路地を思い出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">손잡고 걸었던 작은 골목길이 떠올라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je repense à ces ruelles traversées main dans la main</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Recuerdo los callejones por los que caminamos tomados de la mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich erinnere mich an die Gassen durch die wir Hand in Hand gingen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lembro do beco por onde andamos de mãos dadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вспоминаю переулок по которому мы гуляли держась за руки</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricordo i vicoli attraversati tenendoci per mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xiang qi qian zhe shou zou guo de xiao xiang</span></p><p begin="1:35.880" end="1:39.660" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.880" end="1:36.190">我</span><span begin="1:36.190" end="1:36.570">依</span><span begin="1:36.570" end="1:36.910">然</span><span begin="1:36.910" end="1:37.300">记</span><span begin="1:37.300" end="1:37.490">得</span> <span begin="1:38.000" end="1:38.180">年</span><span begin="1:38.180" end="1:38.350">少</span><span begin="1:38.350" end="1:38.520">初</span><span begin="1:38.520" end="1:38.720">吻</span><span begin="1:38.720" end="1:38.900">的</span><span begin="1:38.900" end="1:38.950">那</span><span begin="1:39.070" end="1:39.430">教</span><span begin="1:39.430" end="1:39.660">堂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我依然記得 年少初吻的那教堂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I still remember the church of our youthful first kiss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">まだ覚えている 若き日の初吻のあの教会を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어릴 적 첫 키스를 했던 그 성당을 여전히 기억해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me souviens encore de l&apos;église de notre premier baiser de jeunesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aún recuerdo la iglesia de nuestro primer beso de juventud</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich erinnere mich noch immer an jene Kirche unseres ersten Kusses in der Jugend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu ainda me lembro daquela igreja do nosso primeiro beijo na juventude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё ещё помню ту церковь нашего первого юношеского поцелуя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricordo ancora la chiesa del nostro primo bacio di gioventù</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo yi ran ji de nian shao chu wen de na jiao tang</span></p><p begin="1:40.130" end="1:46.280" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.130" end="1:40.570">还</span><span begin="1:40.570" end="1:40.950">有</span><span begin="1:40.950" end="1:41.070">一</span><span begin="1:41.220" end="1:41.640">起</span><span begin="1:41.640" end="1:41.990">画</span><span begin="1:41.990" end="1:42.200">爱</span><span begin="1:42.300" end="1:42.900">心</span> <span begin="1:43.430" end="1:43.820">的</span><span begin="1:43.820" end="1:44.160">那</span><span begin="1:44.160" end="1:44.480">道</span><span begin="1:44.480" end="1:46.280">墙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還有一起畫愛心 的那道牆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And the wall where we drew a heart together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そして一緒にハートを描いた あの壁のことも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 함께 하트를 그렸던 그 벽도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et de ce mur où nous avions dessiné un cœur ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y esa pared donde dibujamos un corazón juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und an jene Wand an der wir zusammen ein Herz malten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E daquela parede onde desenhamos um coração juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И ту стену где мы вместе нарисовали сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E quel muro dove abbiamo disegnato un cuore insieme</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hai you yi qi hua ai xin de na dao qiang</span></p><p begin="2:03.010" end="2:06.140" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.010" end="2:03.150">霓</span><span begin="2:03.150" end="2:03.340">虹</span><span begin="2:03.340" end="2:03.480">灯</span><span begin="2:03.480" end="2:03.670">闪</span><span begin="2:03.670" end="2:03.850">烁</span><span begin="2:03.850" end="2:04.030">的</span><span begin="2:04.030" end="2:04.430">倒</span><span begin="2:04.430" end="2:04.970">影</span> <span begin="2:04.970" end="2:05.100">靠</span><span begin="2:05.100" end="2:05.470">在</span><span begin="2:05.470" end="2:05.800">窗</span><span begin="2:05.800" end="2:06.140">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">霓虹燈閃爍的倒影 靠在窗上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The flickering reflection of neon lights leans against the window</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ネオンの瞬く影が 窓辺に寄り添う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">반짝이는 네온사인 불빛이 창문에 비치고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le reflet scintillant des néons s&apos;appuie contre la vitre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El reflejo parpadeante de las luces de neón se apoya en la ventana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die flackernden Spiegelungen der Neonlichter lehnen am Fenster</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O reflexo cintilante das luzes de neon encosta na janela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мерцающее отражение неоновых огней ложится на окно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il riflesso tremolante delle luci al neon si appoggia sulla finestra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ni hong deng shan shuo de dao ying kao zai chuang shang</span></p><p begin="2:07.250" end="2:10.790" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.250" end="2:07.480">错</span><span begin="2:07.480" end="2:07.660">过</span><span begin="2:07.660" end="2:07.840">美</span><span begin="2:07.840" end="2:08.020">好</span><span begin="2:08.020" end="2:08.190">的</span><span begin="2:08.190" end="2:08.350">那</span><span begin="2:08.350" end="2:08.740">时</span><span begin="2:08.740" end="2:09.300">光</span> <span begin="2:09.300" end="2:09.440">能</span><span begin="2:09.440" end="2:09.830">否</span><span begin="2:09.830" end="2:10.180">再</span><span begin="2:10.180" end="2:10.510">遇</span><span begin="2:10.510" end="2:10.790">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">錯過美好的那時光 能否再遇上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Can the missed beautiful times be encountered again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すれ違ったあの美しい時間に また巡り会えるだろうか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">놓쳐버린 그 아름다운 시절을 다시 만날 수 있을까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces beaux moments manqués pourrons-nous nous y recroiser ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esos hermosos tiempos perdidos podré volver a encontrarlos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Können wir jene verpasste schöne Zeit wohl wiederfinden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Aquele belo tempo perdido será que podemos encontrar de novo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сможем ли мы вновь встретить то прекрасное упущенное время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Potrò mai ritrovare quei bei momenti perduti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">cuo guo mei hao de na shi guang neng fou zai yu shang</span></p><p begin="2:11.650" end="2:15.130" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.650" end="2:11.810">老</span><span begin="2:11.810" end="2:11.990">旧</span><span begin="2:11.990" end="2:12.320">的</span><span begin="2:12.320" end="2:12.700">车</span><span begin="2:12.700" end="2:13.020">站</span> <span begin="2:13.790" end="2:13.970">空</span><span begin="2:13.970" end="2:14.170">旷</span><span begin="2:14.170" end="2:14.480">的</span><span begin="2:14.480" end="2:14.850">车</span><span begin="2:14.850" end="2:15.130">厢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">老舊的車站 空曠的車廂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The old station and the empty carriage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">古びた駅 がらんとした車両</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">낡고 오래된 역, 텅 빈 객차</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La vieille gare les wagons déserts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La vieja estación los vagones vacíos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein alter Bahnhof und leere Waggons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A velha estação os vagões vazios</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старая станция пустой вагон</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La vecchia stazione le carrozze vuote</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">lao jiu de che zhan kong kuang de che xiang</span></p><p begin="2:15.950" end="2:18.480" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.950" end="2:16.150">怀</span><span begin="2:16.150" end="2:16.300">念</span><span begin="2:16.300" end="2:16.500">从</span><span begin="2:16.500" end="2:16.680">前</span><span begin="2:16.680" end="2:16.850">的</span><span begin="2:16.850" end="2:17.070">人</span><span begin="2:17.070" end="2:17.420">来</span><span begin="2:17.420" end="2:17.770">人</span><span begin="2:17.770" end="2:18.480">往</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">懷念從前的人來人往</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Missing the bustling crowds from the past</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">昔の人の行き交う姿が懐かしい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">예전에 북적이던 사람들이 그리워져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nostalgique du va-et-vient des gens d&apos;autrefois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Extraño el ir y venir de la gente de antes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich vermisse das geschäftige Treiben von einst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sinto falta do vai e vem de pessoas de antigamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скучаю по суете людей что была раньше</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mi manca il viavai di persone di un tempo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">huai nian cong qian de ren lai ren wang</span></p><p begin="2:20.260" end="2:23.680" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.260" end="2:20.500">招</span><span begin="2:20.500" end="2:20.570">牌</span><span begin="2:20.680" end="2:21.010">的</span><span begin="2:21.010" end="2:21.370">灯</span><span begin="2:21.370" end="2:21.570">泡</span> <span begin="2:22.440" end="2:22.620">在</span><span begin="2:22.620" end="2:22.830">夜</span><span begin="2:22.830" end="2:23.180">里</span><span begin="2:23.180" end="2:23.580">微</span><span begin="2:23.580" end="2:23.680">亮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">招牌的燈泡 在夜裡微亮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The signboard&apos;s lightbulb shines faintly in the night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">看板の電球が 夜の帳にほのかに灯る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">간판의 전구는 밤중에 희미하게 빛나고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les ampoules de l&apos;enseigne brillent doucement dans la nuit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las bombillas del letrero brillan tenuemente en la noche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Glühbirne des Schildes leuchtet schwach in der Nacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As lâmpadas do letreiro brilham fracamente na noite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лампочка на вывеске тускло светится в ночи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le lampadine dell&apos;insegna brillano debolmente nella notte</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zhao pai de deng pao zai ye li wei liang</span></p><p begin="2:24.620" end="2:27.910" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.620" end="2:24.810">过</span><span begin="2:24.810" end="2:24.990">去</span><span begin="2:24.990" end="2:25.260">的</span><span begin="2:25.370" end="2:25.580">背</span><span begin="2:25.710" end="2:26.070">包</span> <span begin="2:26.070" end="2:26.470">就</span><span begin="2:26.470" end="2:26.710">留</span><span begin="2:26.810" end="2:27.170">在</span><span begin="2:27.170" end="2:27.310">异</span><span begin="2:27.500" end="2:27.910">乡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">過去的背包 就留在異鄉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The backpack of the past is left in a foreign land</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">過去のバックパックは 異郷に置いてきた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">과거의 배낭은 타향에 남겨둔 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J&apos;ai laissé mon sac à dos du passé dans cette terre étrangère</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La mochila del pasado se queda en una tierra extranjera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den Rucksack der Vergangenheit lasse ich in der Fremde zurück</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A mochila do passado fica na terra estrangeira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старый рюкзак так и остался на чужбине</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lo zaino del passato è rimasto in una terra straniera</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">guo qu de bei bao jiu liu zai yi xiang</span></p><p begin="2:28.800" end="2:34.020" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.800" end="2:28.950">于</span><span begin="2:28.950" end="2:29.360">是</span><span begin="2:29.360" end="2:29.550">我</span><span begin="2:29.660" end="2:29.910">决</span><span begin="2:30.050" end="2:30.420">定</span> <span begin="2:30.420" end="2:30.610">离</span><span begin="2:30.720" end="2:31.100">开</span><span begin="2:31.100" end="2:31.500">这</span><span begin="2:31.500" end="2:31.760">个</span><span begin="2:31.870" end="2:32.190">地</span><span begin="2:32.190" end="2:34.020">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">於是我決定 離開這個地方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So I decided to leave this place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だから僕は この場所を離れると決めた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래서 난 이 곳을 떠나기로 했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors j&apos;ai décidé de quitter cet endroit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así que decidí irme de este lugar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Also beschließe ich diesen Ort zu verlassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então eu decidi sair deste lugar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я решил покинуть это место</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così ho deciso di lasciare questo posto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu shi wo jue ding li kai zhe ge di fang</span></p><p begin="2:36.570" end="2:40.080" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.570" end="2:36.950">当</span><span begin="2:36.950" end="2:37.080">你</span><span begin="2:37.250" end="2:37.690">收</span><span begin="2:37.690" end="2:38.010">到</span><span begin="2:38.010" end="2:38.370">信</span> <span begin="2:38.370" end="2:38.690">我</span><span begin="2:38.690" end="2:39.080">还</span><span begin="2:39.080" end="2:39.460">在</span><span begin="2:39.460" end="2:39.840">流</span><span begin="2:39.840" end="2:40.080">浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當你收到信 我還在流浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you receive the letter I am still wandering</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君が手紙を受け取る頃 僕はまだ彷徨っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 편지를 받을 때쯤, 난 여전히 방랑하고 있겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand tu recevras cette lettre j&apos;errerai encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando recibas la carta yo todavía estaré vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du diesen Brief erhältst wandere ich noch immer umher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando você receber a carta eu ainda estarei vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда ты получишь письмо я всё ещё буду странствовать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando riceverai la lettera io starò ancora vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dang ni shou dao xin wo hai zai liu lang</span></p><p begin="2:40.890" end="2:44.410" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.890" end="2:41.280">那</span><span begin="2:41.280" end="2:41.640">年</span><span begin="2:41.640" end="2:41.970">的</span><span begin="2:41.970" end="2:42.380">约</span><span begin="2:42.380" end="2:42.720">定</span> <span begin="2:42.720" end="2:42.920">都</span><span begin="2:43.020" end="2:43.430">放</span><span begin="2:43.430" end="2:43.620">在</span><span begin="2:43.750" end="2:44.120">心</span><span begin="2:44.120" end="2:44.410">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那年的約定 都放在心上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The promise from that year is kept in my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの年の約束は 全て心にしまってある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그해의 약속은 모두 마음속에 간직하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les promesses de cette année-là je les garde dans mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las promesas de aquel año las guardo todas en mi corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Versprechen von damals trage ich tief im Herzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A promessa daquele ano está toda guardada no coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Обещание того года всё ещё храню в сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tengo ancora nel cuore la promessa di quell&apos;anno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na nian de yue ding dou fang zai xin shang</span></p><p begin="2:45.190" end="2:49.090" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.190" end="2:45.590">随</span><span begin="2:45.590" end="2:45.960">身</span><span begin="2:45.960" end="2:46.110">的</span><span begin="2:46.110" end="2:46.300">照</span><span begin="2:46.300" end="2:46.680">片</span><span begin="2:46.680" end="2:46.910">里</span> <span begin="2:47.400" end="2:47.770">你</span><span begin="2:47.770" end="2:47.880">微</span><span begin="2:48.050" end="2:48.310">笑</span><span begin="2:48.310" end="2:48.380">的</span><span begin="2:48.500" end="2:48.860">模</span><span begin="2:48.860" end="2:49.090">样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">隨身的照片裡 你微笑的模樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your smiling face in the photo I carry with me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">持ち歩く写真の中の 君の微笑む姿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">늘 지니고 다니는 사진 속 네가 웃는 모습</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans la photo que je garde sur moi la douceur de ton sourire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En la foto que llevo conmigo tu forma de sonreír</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf dem Foto das ich bei mir trage ist dein Lächeln zu sehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Na foto que carrego comigo o jeito do seu sorriso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">На фотографии что всегда со мной твоя улыбка</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nella foto che porto con me c&apos;è il tuo sorriso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sui shen de zhao pian li ni wei xiao de mo yang</span></p><p begin="2:49.550" end="2:53.480" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.550" end="2:49.940">亲</span><span begin="2:49.940" end="2:50.310">爱</span><span begin="2:50.310" end="2:50.580">的</span> <span begin="2:50.690" end="2:50.810">你</span><span begin="2:50.970" end="2:51.360">现</span><span begin="2:51.360" end="2:51.630">在</span><span begin="2:51.730" end="2:52.460">怎</span><span begin="2:52.460" end="2:52.860">么</span><span begin="2:52.860" end="2:53.480">样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親愛的 你現在怎麼樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My dear how are you doing now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">親愛なる君よ 今はどうしているの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 사랑, 넌 지금 어떻게 지내고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ma chérie comment vas-tu à présent ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Querida cómo estás tú ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Liebling wie geht es dir jetzt?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Querida como você está agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дорогая как ты сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mia cara come stai adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">qin ai de ni xian zai zen me yang</span></p><p begin="2:53.920" end="2:57.400" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.920" end="2:54.290">当</span><span begin="2:54.290" end="2:54.400">你</span><span begin="2:54.600" end="2:55.000">收</span><span begin="2:55.000" end="2:55.350">到</span><span begin="2:55.350" end="2:55.720">信</span> <span begin="2:55.720" end="2:56.030">我</span><span begin="2:56.030" end="2:56.460">还</span><span begin="2:56.460" end="2:56.840">在</span><span begin="2:56.840" end="2:57.200">流</span><span begin="2:57.200" end="2:57.400">浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當你收到信 我還在流浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you receive the letter I am still wandering</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君が手紙を受け取る頃 僕はまだ彷徨っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 편지를 받을 때쯤, 난 여전히 방랑하고 있겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand tu recevras cette lettre j&apos;errerai encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando recibas la carta yo todavía estaré vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du diesen Brief erhältst wandere ich noch immer umher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando você receber a carta eu ainda estarei vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда ты получишь письмо я всё ещё буду странствовать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando riceverai la lettera io starò ancora vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dang ni shou dao xin wo hai zai liu lang</span></p><p begin="2:58.190" end="3:01.730" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.190" end="2:58.610">想</span><span begin="2:58.610" end="2:58.840">起</span><span begin="2:58.940" end="2:59.320">牵</span><span begin="2:59.320" end="2:59.670">着</span><span begin="2:59.670" end="3:00.040">手</span> <span begin="3:00.040" end="3:00.410">走</span><span begin="3:00.410" end="3:00.810">过</span><span begin="3:00.810" end="3:00.970">的</span><span begin="3:01.110" end="3:01.490">小</span><span begin="3:01.490" end="3:01.730">巷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想起牽著手 走過的小巷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Thinking of the alley we walked through holding hands</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">手を繋いで歩いた あの路地を思い出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">손잡고 걸었던 작은 골목길이 떠올라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je repense à ces ruelles traversées main dans la main</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Recuerdo los callejones por los que caminamos tomados de la mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich erinnere mich an die Gassen durch die wir Hand in Hand gingen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lembro do beco por onde andamos de mãos dadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вспоминаю переулок по которому мы гуляли держась за руки</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricordo i vicoli attraversati tenendoci per mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xiang qi qian zhe shou zou guo de xiao xiang</span></p><p begin="3:02.620" end="3:06.420" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.620" end="3:02.930">我</span><span begin="3:02.930" end="3:03.310">依</span><span begin="3:03.310" end="3:03.650">然</span><span begin="3:03.650" end="3:04.040">记</span><span begin="3:04.040" end="3:04.250">得</span> <span begin="3:04.750" end="3:04.920">年</span><span begin="3:04.920" end="3:05.100">少</span><span begin="3:05.100" end="3:05.260">初</span><span begin="3:05.260" end="3:05.470">吻</span><span begin="3:05.470" end="3:05.640">的</span><span begin="3:05.640" end="3:05.700">那</span><span begin="3:05.810" end="3:06.080">教</span><span begin="3:06.180" end="3:06.420">堂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我依然記得 年少初吻的那教堂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I still remember the church of our youthful first kiss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">まだ覚えている 若き日の初吻のあの教会を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어릴 적 첫 키스를 했던 그 성당을 여전히 기억해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me souviens encore de l&apos;église de notre premier baiser de jeunesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aún recuerdo la iglesia de nuestro primer beso de juventud</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich erinnere mich noch immer an jene Kirche unseres ersten Kusses in der Jugend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu ainda me lembro daquela igreja do nosso primeiro beijo na juventude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё ещё помню ту церковь нашего первого юношеского поцелуя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricordo ancora la chiesa del nostro primo bacio di gioventù</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo yi ran ji de nian shao chu wen de na jiao tang</span></p><p begin="3:06.880" end="3:13.020" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.880" end="3:07.310">还</span><span begin="3:07.310" end="3:07.690">有</span><span begin="3:07.690" end="3:07.810">一</span><span begin="3:07.950" end="3:08.280">起</span><span begin="3:08.380" end="3:08.740">画</span><span begin="3:08.740" end="3:08.940">爱</span><span begin="3:09.050" end="3:09.620">心</span> <span begin="3:10.180" end="3:10.570">的</span><span begin="3:10.570" end="3:10.920">那</span><span begin="3:10.920" end="3:11.220">道</span><span begin="3:11.220" end="3:13.020">墙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還有一起畫愛心 的那道牆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And the wall where we drew a heart together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そして一緒にハートを描いた あの壁のことも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 함께 하트를 그렸던 그 벽도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et de ce mur où nous avions dessiné un cœur ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y esa pared donde dibujamos un corazón juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und an jene Wand an der wir zusammen ein Herz malten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E daquela parede onde desenhamos um coração juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И ту стену где мы вместе нарисовали сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E quel muro dove abbiamo disegnato un cuore insieme</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hai you yi qi hua ai xin de na dao qiang</span></p><p begin="3:28.630" end="3:32.140" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.630" end="3:29.010">当</span><span begin="3:29.010" end="3:29.140">你</span><span begin="3:29.310" end="3:29.720">收</span><span begin="3:29.720" end="3:30.070">到</span><span begin="3:30.070" end="3:30.420">信</span> <span begin="3:30.420" end="3:30.750">我</span><span begin="3:30.750" end="3:31.140">还</span><span begin="3:31.140" end="3:31.520">在</span><span begin="3:31.520" end="3:31.900">流</span><span begin="3:31.900" end="3:32.140">浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當你收到信 我還在流浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you receive the letter I am still wandering</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君が手紙を受け取る頃 僕はまだ彷徨っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 편지를 받을 때쯤, 난 여전히 방랑하고 있겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand tu recevras cette lettre j&apos;errerai encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando recibas la carta yo todavía estaré vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du diesen Brief erhältst wandere ich noch immer umher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando você receber a carta eu ainda estarei vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда ты получишь письмо я всё ещё буду странствовать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando riceverai la lettera io starò ancora vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dang ni shou dao xin wo hai zai liu lang</span></p><p begin="3:32.960" end="3:36.460" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.960" end="3:33.340">那</span><span begin="3:33.340" end="3:33.680">年</span><span begin="3:33.680" end="3:34.020">的</span><span begin="3:34.020" end="3:34.420">约</span><span begin="3:34.420" end="3:34.760">定</span> <span begin="3:34.760" end="3:34.970">都</span><span begin="3:35.070" end="3:35.480">放</span><span begin="3:35.480" end="3:35.670">在</span><span begin="3:35.800" end="3:36.180">心</span><span begin="3:36.180" end="3:36.460">上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那年的約定 都放在心上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The promise from that year is kept in my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの年の約束は 全て心にしまってある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그해의 약속은 모두 마음속에 간직하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les promesses de cette année-là je les garde dans mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las promesas de aquel año las guardo todas en mi corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Versprechen von damals trage ich tief im Herzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A promessa daquele ano está toda guardada no coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Обещание того года всё ещё храню в сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tengo ancora nel cuore la promessa di quell&apos;anno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na nian de yue ding dou fang zai xin shang</span></p><p begin="3:37.240" end="3:41.130" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:37.240" end="3:37.640">随</span><span begin="3:37.640" end="3:38.010">身</span><span begin="3:38.010" end="3:38.150">的</span><span begin="3:38.150" end="3:38.350">照</span><span begin="3:38.350" end="3:38.730">片</span><span begin="3:38.730" end="3:38.960">里</span> <span begin="3:39.450" end="3:39.820">你</span><span begin="3:39.820" end="3:39.940">微</span><span begin="3:40.100" end="3:40.350">笑</span><span begin="3:40.350" end="3:40.410">的</span><span begin="3:40.560" end="3:40.910">模</span><span begin="3:40.910" end="3:41.130">样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">隨身的照片裡 你微笑的模樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Your smiling face in the photo I carry with me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">持ち歩く写真の中の 君の微笑む姿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">늘 지니고 다니는 사진 속 네가 웃는 모습</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans la photo que je garde sur moi la douceur de ton sourire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En la foto que llevo conmigo tu forma de sonreír</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auf dem Foto das ich bei mir trage ist dein Lächeln zu sehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Na foto que carrego comigo o jeito do seu sorriso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">На фотографии что всегда со мной твоя улыбка</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nella foto che porto con me c&apos;è il tuo sorriso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sui shen de zhao pian li ni wei xiao de mo yang</span></p><p begin="3:41.600" end="3:45.530" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:41.600" end="3:41.990">亲</span><span begin="3:41.990" end="3:42.360">爱</span><span begin="3:42.360" end="3:42.640">的</span> <span begin="3:42.740" end="3:42.860">你</span><span begin="3:43.020" end="3:43.410">现</span><span begin="3:43.410" end="3:43.680">在</span><span begin="3:43.780" end="3:44.510">怎</span><span begin="3:44.510" end="3:44.900">么</span><span begin="3:44.900" end="3:45.530">样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親愛的 你現在怎麼樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My dear how are you doing now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">親愛なる君よ 今はどうしているの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 사랑, 넌 지금 어떻게 지내고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ma chérie comment vas-tu à présent ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Querida cómo estás tú ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Liebling wie geht es dir jetzt?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Querida como você está agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Дорогая как ты сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mia cara come stai adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">qin ai de ni xian zai zen me yang</span></p><p begin="3:45.960" end="3:49.450" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:45.960" end="3:46.330">当</span><span begin="3:46.330" end="3:46.440">你</span><span begin="3:46.650" end="3:47.050">收</span><span begin="3:47.050" end="3:47.400">到</span><span begin="3:47.400" end="3:47.760">信</span> <span begin="3:47.760" end="3:48.070">我</span><span begin="3:48.070" end="3:48.500">还</span><span begin="3:48.500" end="3:48.870">在</span><span begin="3:48.870" end="3:49.250">流</span><span begin="3:49.250" end="3:49.450">浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當你收到信 我還在流浪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When you receive the letter I am still wandering</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君が手紙を受け取る頃 僕はまだ彷徨っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 편지를 받을 때쯤, 난 여전히 방랑하고 있겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand tu recevras cette lettre j&apos;errerai encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando recibas la carta yo todavía estaré vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du diesen Brief erhältst wandere ich noch immer umher</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando você receber a carta eu ainda estarei vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда ты получишь письмо я всё ещё буду странствовать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando riceverai la lettera io starò ancora vagando</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dang ni shou dao xin wo hai zai liu lang</span></p><p begin="3:50.240" end="3:53.800" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.240" end="3:50.650">想</span><span begin="3:50.650" end="3:50.900">起</span><span begin="3:51.000" end="3:51.380">牵</span><span begin="3:51.380" end="3:51.720">着</span><span begin="3:51.720" end="3:52.090">手</span> <span begin="3:52.090" end="3:52.460">走</span><span begin="3:52.460" end="3:52.860">过</span><span begin="3:52.860" end="3:53.020">的</span><span begin="3:53.150" end="3:53.540">小</span><span begin="3:53.540" end="3:53.800">巷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想起牽著手 走過的小巷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Thinking of the alley we walked through holding hands</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">手を繋いで歩いた あの路地を思い出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">손잡고 걸었던 작은 골목길이 떠올라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je repense à ces ruelles traversées main dans la main</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Recuerdo los callejones por los que caminamos tomados de la mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich erinnere mich an die Gassen durch die wir Hand in Hand gingen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Lembro do beco por onde andamos de mãos dadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вспоминаю переулок по которому мы гуляли держась за руки</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricordo i vicoli attraversati tenendoci per mano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">xiang qi qian zhe shou zou guo de xiao xiang</span></p><p begin="3:54.670" end="3:58.460" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:54.670" end="3:54.980">我</span><span begin="3:54.980" end="3:55.360">依</span><span begin="3:55.360" end="3:55.700">然</span><span begin="3:55.700" end="3:56.090">记</span><span begin="3:56.090" end="3:56.310">得</span> <span begin="3:56.800" end="3:56.970">年</span><span begin="3:56.970" end="3:57.140">少</span><span begin="3:57.140" end="3:57.310">初</span><span begin="3:57.310" end="3:57.510">吻</span><span begin="3:57.510" end="3:57.690">的</span><span begin="3:57.690" end="3:57.750">那</span><span begin="3:57.860" end="3:58.220">教</span><span begin="3:58.220" end="3:58.460">堂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我依然記得 年少初吻的那教堂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I still remember the church of our youthful first kiss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">まだ覚えている 若き日の初吻のあの教会を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어릴 적 첫 키스를 했던 그 성당을 여전히 기억해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je me souviens encore de l&apos;église de notre premier baiser de jeunesse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aún recuerdo la iglesia de nuestro primer beso de juventud</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich erinnere mich noch immer an jene Kirche unseres ersten Kusses in der Jugend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu ainda me lembro daquela igreja do nosso primeiro beijo na juventude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё ещё помню ту церковь нашего первого юношеского поцелуя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricordo ancora la chiesa del nostro primo bacio di gioventù</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wo yi ran ji de nian shao chu wen de na jiao tang</span></p><p begin="3:58.920" end="4:05.070" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:58.920" end="3:59.360">还</span><span begin="3:59.360" end="3:59.740">有</span><span begin="3:59.740" end="3:59.850">一</span><span begin="4:00.010" end="4:00.430">起</span><span begin="4:00.430" end="4:00.780">画</span><span begin="4:00.780" end="4:00.990">爱</span><span begin="4:01.090" end="4:01.670">心</span> <span begin="4:02.230" end="4:02.610">的</span><span begin="4:02.610" end="4:02.960">那</span><span begin="4:02.960" end="4:03.270">道</span><span begin="4:03.270" end="4:05.070">墙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">還有一起畫愛心 的那道牆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And the wall where we drew a heart together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そして一緒にハートを描いた あの壁のことも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 함께 하트를 그렸던 그 벽도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et de ce mur où nous avions dessiné un cœur ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y esa pared donde dibujamos un corazón juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und an jene Wand an der wir zusammen ein Herz malten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E daquela parede onde desenhamos um coração juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И ту стену где мы вместе нарисовали сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E quel muro dove abbiamo disegnato un cuore insieme</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hai you yi qi hua ai xin de na dao qiang</span></p></div></body></tt>